  "description": "Full suspension speed and comfort is accompanied by fun and performance with the Rapide FS.\n\nNew for 2021 is the Vitus Rapide FS, this is a bike made for all out speed on the roughest of courses. Whether it is an XC sprint, marathon epic, or all-day mission, this bike is designed to go fast. Equipped with Shimano drivetrain and brakes, Rockshox SID suspension, and Maxxis racing series tyres, it is ready to chase the top step of the podium.\n\nThis model means business with its fiery racing red colour matching the performance on offer from Rockshox SID SL Ultimate forks and SIDLuxe rear shock. Shimano 1x12 speed XT drivetrain is crisp and reliable ensuring you get the shift you need, with the powerful Shimano M8100 XT brakes.\n\nAcceleration and control are offered by DT Swiss X1700 wheels and Maxxis Rekon Race tyres. Finishing this setup off is the Ritchey WCS.\n\n*Due to volatility in the bicycle supply chain we may slightly alter the specification of the component parts supplied with this bicycle. Where this happens we have listed the alternate product in the specification table and have ensured that this is of either equivalent or superior specification to the stock component.\n\nFull Carbon Frame for XC/Marathon racing\n\nRockshox SID Ultimate 100mm/Rockshox Sidluxe Select+ Suspension\n\nShimano 1x12spd M8100 XT Drivetrain\n\nDT Swiss X1700 Wheels\n\nMaxxis Rekon Race Tyres\n\nRitchey WCS Finishing Kit",
